WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes of sound. An hour of meditation. That's the promise.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But a duration, a feeling and a measured brain signal are three different things.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A review of fourteen brainwave studies found results that didn't agree.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A newer experiment found some effects only under specific listening conditions.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Neither tested the finished Zen12 program. So what is actually for sale?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence. Try the free exercise. Decide on the actual offer, not the headline.
